From: LIyang-linux <196529580+LIyang-linux@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: add SiliconMitus SM5703 MFD, regulators, vibrator and flash LED

Add the SiliconMitus SM5703 multi-function device support used by the
Samsung Galaxy On7 (SM-G6000 / on7ltechn):

  - MFD core that creates platform devices for the sub-nodes
  - LDO regulator driver (LDO2 supplies the vibrator, "VDD_MOTOR")
  - vibrator driver on the mainline timed_output API
  - minimal flash LED driver on the standard LED class

Register map and register usage are taken from the downstream Samsung
drivers (GPL-2.0): drivers/mfd/sm5703_core.c, drivers/regulator/
sm5703_regulator.c, drivers/motor/sm5703_vibrator.c and
drivers/leds/sm5703_fled.c.

Signed-off-by: LIyang-linux <196529580+LIyang-linux@users.noreply.github.com>
